# --- rxiv-maker build artifacts ---------------------------------------------

# Generated body file: build.py derives 01_MAIN.md from the source markdown
# (README.md / MEMEX_WHITEPAPER.md) on every build, then deletes it. It should
# never be committed — the source markdown + 00_CONFIG.yml are the truth.
*/01_MAIN.md

# rxiv build output directory (PDF, .tex, .aux, .log, .bbl, etc.)
*/output/

# The PDF copy rxiv drops in each paper folder root
# */2026__*.pdf
# */*__*_et_al__*.pdf

# PDF preview renders
*/output/_preview*.png
*/_preview*.png

# --- stray LaTeX aux files (if any are ever produced outside output/) -------
*.aux
*.bbl
*.blg
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.synctex.gz
*.out
*.toc

# --- python ----------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.pyc
